{"hw":"μάθησις","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">μάθησις</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">μάθ-ησις</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">εως</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">μαθεῖν</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">the act of learning, getting of knowledge</b>, <span class=\"gk\">πεῖρά τοι μαθήσιος ἀρχά</span> Alem.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">63</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μ. οὐ καλὴν ἐκμανθάνεις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">450</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὧν μάθησιν ἄρνυμαι</span> of which things I gain <b class=\"lex-tr\">information</b>, ib. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">711</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μ. ἔχειν τινός</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Supp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">915</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὁ χρόνος μ. δίδωσι</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">419</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὴν μ. ποιεῖσθαι περί τινος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.68</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἡ περὶ τὸ ἓν μ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">525a</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μ. τέχνης</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">BGU</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1021.8</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(iii A. D.)</span>: in pl., <span class=\"gk\">νωθροὶ ἀπαντῶσι πρὸς τὰς μ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tht.<